00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:25.920
-Now, do you know who you are?

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:27.220
-What you are?

00:00:27.280 --> 00:00:28.180
Am I...

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:29.500
human?

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:30.100
-*chuckling*

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:31.380
-*whispering* It thinks it's human.

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.480
-*clear throat* No that was ahhh good....good guess.

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:34.860
-But aaah, try searching your memory.

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:35.960
Assholes,

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:39.460
I bet they didn't have to figure out the 
meaning of existence one minute after they were born.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:40.840
My name's-

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:43.140
My name's Waifubot 2.0

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:46.040
I'm a sentient program created to aid humanity.

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:46.740
-Correct!

00:00:46.740 --> 00:00:48.300
